:artwork_20260104_013158_608 rdf:type arto:Artwork ;
    dcterms:title "Artwork 20260104 013158 608"@en ;
    dcterms:description """A Neoclassicism painting depicting a grand afternoon scene in a classical interior with natural soft light filtering through tall windows, creating a bright yet subdued atmosphere that feels both active and gentle. Dominating the foreground is a deep burgundy bed with dark mahogany frame, its pristine velvet upholstery appearing well-maintained. Arranged carefully upon the bed's surface are four objects in deliberate composition: a medium-sized trophy cup of cool silver with soft gray antique tarnish in its recesses sits centrally; beside it rests a small pear of muted chartreuse and olive green tones, treated as an artistic object; nearby lies a small dagger with cool steel gray blade and warm bronze patina decorative hilt; and completing the arrangement is a medium-sized wheel model meticulously crafted from dark umber and warm walnut wood. The spatial relationships show all objects resting directly on the bed's surface in a balanced Neoclassical arrangement, with the trophy cup as focal point flanked by the pear and dagger, while the wheel occupies its own space nearby. The overall environment conveys classical harmony through precise lighting that highlights textures of mahogany wood, silver metal, glazed ceramic-like fruit, steel and bronze weaponry, and wooden craftsmanship."""@en ;
    arto:style aat:300056093 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-01-04T01:32:47.582335"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "AI Artwork Generation System" ;
    arto:medium arto:DigitalMedium .

