    rdfs:label "Wheel"@en ;
    arto:cocoCategory "bicycle" ;
    arto:hasSize :MediumSize ;
    dcterms:description "A miniature model of a spoked wheel, crafted from dark, finely-grained wood. The diffused afternoon light catches the rounded edges of the spokes, creating soft, linear highlights that trace the wheel's form. The dark wood appears almost black in its recesses, while the polished surfaces show a deep, warm brown tone, a subtle reminder of the wood's natural color beneath the cool atmospheric light."@en ;
